          "es": "El Bhagavata Purana dice que Bhavani conocía su poder, y estuvo de acuerdo.",
          "en": "The Bhagavata Purana says that Bhavani knew his power, and she agreed."
        },
        {
          "es": "Shiva se levantó y caminó hacia el veneno.",
          "en": "Shiva stood up and walked toward the poison."
