      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces, de pie sobre un loto, subió una diosa llena de luz: Lakshmi.",
          "en": "Then, standing on a lotus, a goddess full of light rose up: Lakshmi."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lakshmi es la diosa de la fortuna y la belleza. Muchos hindúes le rezan hoy para tener prosperidad.",
          "en": "Lakshmi is the goddess of fortune and beauty. Many Hindus pray to her today for prosperity."
        },
        {
          "es": "Dioses, asuras y sabios esperaban que ella los eligiera.",
          "en": "Gods, asuras and sages all hoped she would choose them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ella los miró uno por uno, buscando a alguien sin ningún defecto.",
          "en": "She looked at each of them, searching for someone with no faults at all."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo encontró en Vishnu. Le puso una guirnalda de lotos y lo eligió para siempre.",
          "en": "She found him in Vishnu. She placed a lotus garland on him, and chose him forever."
        }
